 "summaries": [
  {
   "section": "Tire",
   "text": "The right rear tire has a low tread depth of 5/32nd."
  },
  {
   "section": "Exterior",
   "text": "The front bumper is misaligned. Refer to picture 14. There are minor misc scratches around the vehicle, most too small to see in photos. The right quarter panel has a dent. Refer to picture 16. The left front door has prior paint in substandard condition. The vehicle had paint protection film installed. The front bumper has been repainted. Work is up to industry standards. The exterior lights were functional and working properly."
  },
  {
   "section": "Interior",
   "text": "There is light wear to the seats. The interior trim and carpet show normal wear. The floor mats are slightly dirty. I did not notice any odd smells or signs that the car had been smoked in. There were also no signs of water leaks. The climate control system operated in all modes and blew the desired temperature. All the interior electronics appeared to operate as designed."
  },
  {
   "section": "Mechanical",
   "text": "The underside panel has some seepage. I'm unable to determine if this is due to a leak, as no parts are being removed from the vehicle. Refer to picture 91. All accessible fluids are on level."
  },
  {
   "section": "Road Test",
   "text": "The vehicle starts up with no issues or unusual sounds. The steering alignment is straight, and engine performance is good. The vehicle shifts through all gears with no issues. The brakes are firm with no pulsations or grinding. I scanned the vehicle's system, and no error codes were found."
  }
 ],
